1
00:00:00,077 --> 00:00:02,164
Berlian Sultan Banjar ini...

2
00:00:02,164 --> 00:00:03,585
tak pernah laku.

3
00:00:03,585 --> 00:00:04,638
Konon...

4
00:00:04,638 --> 00:00:05,652
terkutuk.

5
00:00:05,652 --> 00:00:07,266
Ia pusaka kerajaan,

6
00:00:07,266 --> 00:00:09,043
lambang kedaulatan sultan.

7
00:00:09,043 --> 00:00:10,976
Belanda merebut Banjarmasin...

8
00:00:10,976 --> 00:00:12,986
berlian ini jadi rampasan perang.

9
00:00:12,986 --> 00:00:14,841
Di Belanda ia diasah...

10
00:00:14,841 --> 00:00:15,932
tetap tak laku.

11
00:00:15,932 --> 00:00:18,357
Akhirnya dipajang di museum Amsterdam...

12
00:00:18,357 --> 00:00:19,575
lebih dari seabad.

13
00:00:19,575 --> 00:00:20,406
Tahun ini,

14
00:00:20,406 --> 00:00:22,918
Belanda resmi
mengembalikannya ke Indonesia!

15
00:00:22,918 --> 00:00:25,507
Tapi ia pergi seberat 70 karat...

16
00:00:25,507 --> 00:00:27,681
dan pulang tinggal 38.

17
00:00:27,681 --> 00:00:29,949
Kirim ke temanmu yang urang Banjar!
